        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Architecture is the most legible artifact of a civilization. Every building is a frozen\nsnapshot of what its builders knew how to do, what they believed, whom they feared, and\nwhat materials lay at hand. The structural system IS the architecture — ornament is the\nannotation on top."
    },
